                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Blackfaun is too early for access.  It looks like it will eventually be a decent rogue like. As it stands now, it is overly unclear what is happening (why am I picking up different colored hearts?, what does a candle do?, etc) and it has some game breaking bugs. Example: After stage one my weapon dissapears and I get spammed with error messages. This is not a one time occurance. It happens every time.  \n\nI look forward to changing my review when some of the major issues get resolved.",
